{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T00:35:33+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Winds & Leaves", "steam_appid": 1783750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [1818350], "detailed_description": "From the developers of the award-winning game Prison Boss VR, Winds &amp; Leaves is now coming to PC VR with enhanced visuals and room-scale support.<br><br>Stranded in a barren landscape, you are the only one alive able to master the ancient art of growing vegetation. Your world is fragile, and you must find a way to end the recurring cataclysms that threaten it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783750/extras/c082521688c089c6e3dcecc5efd879ea.avif?t=1746736289\" width=600 height=91 /></span><br><br>Grow a verdant forest from nothing and create different tree species to adapt to the various biomes and weather. Transform the barren land into lush valleys, one tree at a time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783750/extras/2ad26c75b562b74f3ce5c77320ee294a.poster.avif?t=1746736289\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783750/extras/2ad26c75b562b74f3ce5c77320ee294a.webm?t=1746736289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783750/extras/2ad26c75b562b74f3ce5c77320ee294a.mp4?t=1746736289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783750/extras/61ab40128d5aa3ee80280bfa20edbbd3.avif?t=1746736289\" width=600 height=91 /></span><br><br>Explore an intriguing ever-changing world on your stilts, a locomotion system designed for walking across the landscapes and cli